<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:20:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>黄金下跌，因为股市继续抛售，投资者等待关键的通胀数据，这可能会影响美联储进一步加息的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slumps Below $3,500 an Ounce to Lowest in More Than a Year&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bullrich 与米莱选举改革会议</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-confia-en-que-la-reforma-electoral-de-milei-sera-aprobada</link><description>帕特里夏·布尔里奇 (Patricia Bullrich) 表示，在阿根廷参议院对 PASO 的投票已足够，将改革 2027 年总统选举日程。（来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-confia-en-que-la-reforma-electoral-de-milei-sera-aprobada'&gt;Bullrich 与米莱选举改革会议&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bullrich confía en que la reforma electoral de Milei será aprobada&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-confia-en-que-la-reforma-electoral-de-milei-sera-aprobada</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:45:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq Futures Tumble as Tech Selloff Rolls On: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于强劲的豆粕需求推动压榨，豆油跌至九个月低点</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/soy-oil-hits-nine-month-low-as-strong-meal-demand-boosts-crush</link><description>豆油价格跌至 2 月份以来的最低水平，因豆粕需求旺盛提振压榨，而原油走软则在美国感恩节假期前增加了压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/soy-oil-hits-nine-month-low-as-strong-meal-demand-boosts-crush'&gt;由于强劲的豆粕需求推动压榨，豆油跌至九个月低点&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Soy Oil Hits Nine-Month Low as Strong Meal Demand Boosts Crush&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/soy-oil-hits-nine-month-low-as-strong-meal-demand-boosts-crush</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:45:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stock Futures Plunge as Renewed AI Worries Fuel Tech Losses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>